1. SINGLE SORT PASS TRACE (Insertion Sort on 5 Cards)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Initial State (i = 0):
Web -> Kor Outfitter -> Forest -> Spirit -> Fury Sliver[cite: 1]

- Pass 1 (i = 1): Current Card -> Kor Outfitter
  Compare with "Web", shift Web right.
  Contents: Kor Outfitter -> Web -> Forest -> Spirit -> Fury Sliver[cite: 1]

- Pass 2 (i = 2): Current Card -> Forest
  Compare and shift Web and Kor Outfitter right.
  Contents: Forest -> Kor Outfitter -> Web -> Spirit -> Fury Sliver[cite: 1]

- Pass 3 (i = 3): Current Card -> Spirit
  Compare with Web (shift right) and Kor Outfitter (stop).
  Contents: Forest -> Kor Outfitter -> Spirit -> Web -> Fury Sliver[cite: 1]

- Pass 4 (i = 4): Current Card -> Fury Sliver
  Compare and shift Web, Spirit, and Kor Outfitter right, stopping at Forest.
  Final Sorted Order: Forest -> Fury Sliver -> Kor Outfitter -> Spirit -> Web[cite: 1]

